abstract: |
  StroopApp is an open-source WPF application designed for administering Stroop tasks in experimental psychology research. It implements the visual cue paradigm described in Mangin et al. (2021, 2022), supporting configurable task parameters, real-time visualization, and multi-language interfaces.
keywords:
  - Stroop task
  - experimental psychology
  - cognitive research
  - visual cues
  - reaction time
  - WPF
  - .NET
